  sig=func (g *briefGovernor) SetEnabled(ctx context.Context, enabled bool) error
  doc=SetEnabled is the control-surface toggle (req 11.3/14.2): enabling creates\nexactly ONE MORNING_BRIEF alarm (idempotent — a second enable with a live\nalarm is a no-op), disabling cancels it immediately. Enable is FAIL-CLOSED:\nthe opt-in flips on only after the alarm is created.
EDGES
