  sig=func (g *briefGovernor) SetPaused(ctx context.Context, paused bool) error
  doc=SetPaused pauses/resumes delivery without disabling. The alarm is retained;\nthe wake handler skips while paused (req 14.2). Persisted so it takes effect\non the next wake without a restart.
