NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.parseBrowserReport kind=func
  digest=b3:21ee58030ef5a79923d3e9f7f13b5ff15807956d241574d19f0af1a68671dbeb file=neo/internal/server/surface.go range=223:277 lang=go exported=false byte_range=7001:8552
  sig=func parseBrowserReport(result string) (url, title, body string)
  doc=parseBrowserReport pulls the URL, title, and a readable text rendering out of\na Playwright tool result. The result looks like:\n\n  - Page URL: https://example.com\n  - Page Title: Example Domain\n  - Page Snapshot:\n    ```yaml\n  - heading "Example Domain" [level=1] [ref=e1]\n  - paragraph: This domain is for use in examples.\n  - link "More information..." [ref=e2]\n    ```\n\nWe render the snapshot as the visible text of the page (headings, prose,\nlinks, buttons), dropping the YAML scaffolding and [ref=…]/[level=…]\nannotations — turning the machine snapshot into a page-like view.
EDGES
  calls=matrix/neo/internal/server.afterLabel,matrix/neo/internal/server.clip,matrix/neo/internal/server.snapshotLineText
  references=matrix/neo/internal/server.afterLabel,matrix/neo/internal/server.body,matrix/neo/internal/server.clip,matrix/neo/internal/server.inSnapshot,matrix/neo/internal/server.lines,matrix/neo/internal/server.ln,matrix/neo/internal/server.maxExcerptChars,matrix/neo/internal/server.maxSnapshotLines,matrix/neo/internal/server.ok,matrix/neo/internal/server.raw,matrix/neo/internal/server.result,matrix/neo/internal/server.snapshotLineText,matrix/neo/internal/server.t,matrix/neo/internal/server.text,matrix/neo/internal/server.title,matrix/neo/internal/server.url,matrix/neo/internal/server.v
  ^calls=matrix/neo/internal/server.fillBrowser
  ^references=matrix/neo/internal/server.fillBrowser
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/server/surface.go

