  digest=b3:d43dae4043f99c1898599b21e3662b9dd8661b657f60428d5014d192b7de9c20 file=neo/internal/server/session.go range=134:139 lang=go exported=false byte_range=5627:5972
  sig=func(task.Status)
  doc=onFinish, when set, is invoked exactly once by drive with the run's\nterminal task status, after the durable ledger Finish. Used by the\nAutomatrix approve path to settle the opportunity that dispatched this\nrun (done -> completion record; failed -> re-pend). Best-effort observer;\nit must not block.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/server.run

NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.run#outageNotified kind=field
  digest=b3:dba59ce0fe4c86c4e50db02e49b430dbc8a923fdc6c1910bc36596465d6b6830 file=neo/internal/server/session.go range=126:132 lang=go exported=false byte_range=5157:5624
  sig=bool
  doc=outageNotified is set once the user has been told the run is still working\nthrough a provider OUTAGE streak (an unreachable/rate-limited upstream), so\nthe reassurance bubble is emitted ONCE per streak instead of on every\nfutile respawn — a down gateway must not spam a fresh "still working"\nmessage every few seconds. Cleared the moment an attempt fails for any\nother reason (real, distinct progress the user should see).
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/server.run

